<title>JAPAN: Iwasaki Electric -Dec/Mar group forecast.</title>
<headline>Iwasaki Electric -Dec/Mar group forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Group)		FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		 22.60		70.89</p>
<p> Current	    350    million	   1.14</p>
<p> Net		  250    million	 332    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.15 yen	   4.19 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Iwasaki Electric Co Ltd makes illumination lamps.</p>
<p>The latest forecasts were for the four-month period</p>
<p>ending March 31, 1997. Actual figures were for the full</p>
<p>year to November 31, 1996, because the company changed</p>
<p>its business term.</p>
</text>
